      "text": "[nomadoor.icon]",
      "userId": "5f0ae250e8cd56001ee2dacc",
      "created": 1793376157,
      "updated": 1793376157
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae4bf9d0000000000c042a9",
      "text": " うぉおおおお",
      "userId": "5f0ae250e8cd56001ee2dacc",
      "created": 1793376157,
      "updated": 1793376160
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae4bfa10000000000c042ab",
      "text": " 　締め切り前が一番楽しい()",
      "userId": "5f0ae250e8cd56001ee2dacc",
      "created": 1793376161,
      "updated": 1793376174
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae4bfc00000000000c042ac",
      "text": " 　完成度90%で飛び込み乗車しました",
      "userId": "5f0ae250e8cd56001ee2dacc",
